close_reason: "Linked-test setup entries (phase=setup) run first in the shared sandbox, stop the run as setup_failed, and require item format 3; --add help no longer claims verification"
contract_change:
  api: "Linked tests: pm test --add/--add-json, pm create/update --test, SDK LinkedTest, TestRunResult, LinkedTestFailureCategory and CURRENT_ITEM_FORMAT_VERSION, MCP pm_test"
  before: "Linked tests had no setup phase, failure_categories had nine keys, and the highest item format was 2"
  after: "A phase=setup entry runs before the item's regular commands in the same sandbox; a failing setup reports setup_failed and every later entry is skipped; failure_categories gains setup_failed; an item with a setup entry is stored at item format 3, which pm 2026.10.10 through 2026.11.13 refuses to read"
  migrate: "Exhaustive consumers of LinkedTestFailureCategory or failure_categories add setup_failed; upgrade every reader, pinned SDK, CI host and Git merge driver before adding a setup entry to a shared tracker"
escape_class: review_caught_late
