  negative_control: "node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/integration/linked-tests/linked-test-setup-phase.integration.spec.ts (the regular command fails without its setup entry, and the test-all case fails when setup entries are deduplicated across items); node scripts/release/workspace-compatibility.mjs --json refuses a published host that reads a format-3 setup item"
